# Allow-list: only the web app and the shared data it reads are uploaded to Vercel.
# Android sources (app/, gradle/), build output and the research archive never leave the repo.
/*
!/web
!/shared
!/vercel.json
!/.vercelignore
/web/node_modules
/web/dist
/web/.vite
/web/test-results
**/build
/docs/plan/research-results.json
/app
/gradle
